			"Message": "build(Maintain): Bump Node.js sidecar version from 22 to 24\n\nUpdate the Build module documentation and test fixtures to reflect the transition from Node.js v22 to v24 for the Cocoon extension host sidecar.\n\nChanges:\n- Process.rs: Update example product names and bundle identifiers to reference \"24NodeVersion\" and \"node.24.debug\"\n- Rhai/mod.rs: Align test fixtures for Development, Production (debug), and Production (release) builds to use NODE_VERSION=\"24\"\n- mod.rs: Update environment setup example to export NODE_VERSION=\"24\"\n\nThis aligns the build configuration with the active Node.js versions installed in the development environment.",
